# ==============================================================================
# PRANPAN MONOREPO ENVIRONMENT TEMPLATE (PHASE 0)
# ==============================================================================
# PRANPAN uses separate environment files for frontend and backend:
#
# 1. Backend environment file: server/.env
#    Copy from server/.env.example:
#      cp server/.env.example server/.env
#
#    Key variables:
#      PORT=5000
#      NODE_ENV=development
#      CLIENT_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173
#      MONGO_URI=mongodb+srv://<username>:<password>@<cluster>.mongodb.net/pranpan?retryWrites=true&w=majority
#      GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_placeholder (Phase 1)
#      JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret_min_32_chars (Phase 2)
#
# 2. Frontend environment file: client/.env
#    Copy from client/.env.example:
#      cp client/.env.example client/.env
#
#    Key variables:
#      VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
#
# NEVER commit .env files to version control!
# ==============================================================================

